      "text": "Survive the zombie apocalypse with Zach Jones of Our Elements Outdoor Learning, a nature-based outdoor education organization rooted in the Hudson Valley.\n\nLearning\n\nEarth, Wind, Fire and Zombies!\n\nSurvive the zombie apocalypse with Zach Jones of Our Elements Outdoor Learning, a nature-based outdoor education organization rooted in the Hudson Valley.\n\nAbout this event\n\nSurvive the zombie apocalypse with Zach Jones of Our Elements Outdoor Learning, a nature-based outdoor education organization rooted in the Hudson Valley. Each day will focus on a different survival skill set, contextualized within a zombie apocalypse scenario to drive engagement and creative thinking. These skills include sourcing and purifying water, starting a fire (safely!) using primitive and traditional methods, basic first aid concepts, and more. This series is for teens in grades 7-12 (as of fall 2026.) Registration is required; participants must attend all four days of the series. This program is made possible through the generous support of New York-Presbyterian. Check the library page for registration, tickets, and any schedule updates.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nPast\n\nDate\n\nThursday, August 13, 2026\n\nTime\n\n11:00 AM - 12:30 PM\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nAddress\n\n100 Martine Avenue, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nEarth, Wind, Fire and Zombies!\n\nAug 12, 2026\n\nSurvive the zombie apocalypse with Zach Jones of Our Elements Outdoor Learning, a nature-based outdoor education organization rooted in the Hudson Valley.\n\nCooking Up Community\n\nJul 22, 2026\n\nJoin Chef Giovanni Green of Break Bread not Hearts for four days of healthy AND delicious cooking!\n\nCooking Up Community\n\nJul 23, 2026\n\nJoin Chef Giovanni Green of Break Bread not Hearts for four days of healthy AND delicious cooking!"
