      "url": "/events/library-musical-bingo-a-self-care-sound-session-2026-07-26/",
      "type": "event",
      "excerpt": "Join us for the ultimate stress relief at our 90s &amp; 2000s Musical Bingo event!",
      "text": "Join us for the ultimate stress relief at our 90s &amp; 2000s Musical Bingo event!\n\nLearning\n\nMusical BINGO: A Self-Care Sound Session\n\nJoin us for the ultimate stress relief at our 90s & 2000s Musical Bingo event!\n\nAbout this event\n\nJoin us for the ultimate stress relief at our 90s & 2000s Musical Bingo event! This high-energy experience boosts happiness by combining nostalgic throwbacks with the excitement of BINGO. You'll have the chance to showcase your pop culture trivia skills, enjoy a rush of happiness with every song you recognize, and compete for fantastic prizes. Come for the ultimate millennial soundtrack, and leave with great memories and bragging rights! Why Musical Bingo is the Ultimate Self-Care: The Ultimate Mood Booster: Music is scientifically proven to lower cortisol (the stress hormone) and release dopamine. We're channeling that science into pure fun! Nostalgia & Connection: Belt out the lyrics to songs you forgot you loved, share laughs with great company, and celebrate each other's wins. Zero Pressure: No singing talent required, no complex rules to follow, and absolutely no stress. Just show up, listen, and play. Prizes & Surprises: Yes, there will be bingo! But more importantly, there will be awesome self-care prizes up for grabs. Check the library page for registration, tickets, and any schedule updates.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nPast\n\nDate\n\nSunday, July 26, 2026\n\nTime\n\n2:00 PM - 3:30 PM\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nAddress\n\n100 Martine Avenue, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nSummer Reading Kickoff featuring Jumpin' Jamie!\n\nJun 27, 2026\n\nCome start your summer vacation at the White Plains Public Library!\n\nCANCELED The Birth of NY in White Plains (History via Igloo)\n\nJun 16, 2026\n\nEVENT CANCELED\n\nThe Birth of NY in White Plains (History via Igloo)\n\nJun 25, 2026\n\nLearn about why the 1776 approval of the Declaration of Independence, specifically at the White Plains court house, was such a big deal for New York and…"
