      "excerpt": "Come start your summer vacation at the White Plains Public Library!",
      "text": "Come start your summer vacation at the White Plains Public Library!\n\nLearning\n\nSummer Reading Kickoff featuring Jumpin' Jamie!\n\nCome start your summer vacation at the White Plains Public Library!\n\nAbout this event\n\nCome start your summer vacation at the White Plains Public Library! Sign up for our summer reading program and get a coupon for a free book when you sign up. Summer reading is for everyone from babies through adults! Meet Rocky the Raptor from 1-1:30. Jumpin' Jamie performs starting at 1:30pm. Face painting from 1:00-3:30pm. Our friends at Recreation & Parks will also be in attendance, raffling off pool passes and basketball camp access to a few lucky attendees! Plus, treats, crafts and more! Check the library page for registration, tickets, and any schedule updates.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nPast\n\nDate\n\nSaturday, June 27, 2026\n\nTime\n\n1:00 PM - 3:30 PM\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nAddress\n\n100 Martine Avenue, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nREVOLUTIONARY SOUNDS!\n\nJul 2, 2026\n\nRevolutionary Sounds explores the rich cultural exchange between European and African music in colonial New York.\n\nComité Noviembre: Reception\n\nJul 16, 2026\n\nThe evening will feature an intimate discussion with Chairwoman Teresa Santiago, accompanied by featured artists, music, light bites, and refreshments.\n\nMusical BINGO: A Self-Care Sound Session\n\nJul 26, 2026\n\nJoin us for the ultimate stress relief at our 90s & 2000s Musical Bingo event!"
