      "url": "/events/library-tell-your-story-zine-making-for-teens-2026-07-01/",
      "type": "event",
      "excerpt": "Explore how artists, writers, and designers use zines (ZEENS) to communicate ideas through words, images, and layout.",
      "text": "Explore how artists, writers, and designers use zines (ZEENS) to communicate ideas through words, images, and layout.\n\nLearning\n\nTell Your Story: Zine-Making for Teens\n\nExplore how artists, writers, and designers use zines (ZEENS) to communicate ideas through words, images, and layout.\n\nAbout this event\n\nExplore how artists, writers, and designers use zines (ZEENS) to communicate ideas through words, images, and layout. Participants will experiment with storytelling, illustration, collage, lettering, and book design while creating a collection of original handmade books inspired by their interests, experiences, and imagination. Students will leave with a mini library of self-made zines and the confidence to continue creating and sharing their work beyond the class. For more information about zines, please check out this page on Erwin's website. This series is for teens in grades 7-12 (as of fall 2026.) Registration is required; participants must attend all four days of the series. This program is made possible through the generous support of New York-Presbyterian. Check the library page for registration, tickets, and any schedule updates.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nPast\n\nDate\n\nWednesday, July 1, 2026\n\nTime\n\n11:00 AM - 12:30 PM\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nAddress\n\n100 Martine Avenue, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nTell Your Story: Zine-Making for Teens\n\nJul 2, 2026\n\nExplore how artists, writers, and designers use zines (ZEENS) to communicate ideas through words, images, and layout.\n\nCooking Up Community\n\nJul 22, 2026\n\nJoin Chef Giovanni Green of Break Bread not Hearts for four days of healthy AND delicious cooking!\n\nCooking Up Community\n\nJul 23, 2026\n\nJoin Chef Giovanni Green of Break Bread not Hearts for four days of healthy AND delicious cooking!"
