      "text": "Join Jeffrey from Inclure, a program developed by the Harris Project &amp; WJCS that brings teens together for fun, supportive, and wellness-centered…\n\nLearning\n\nWellness Connection\n\nJoin Jeffrey from Inclure, a program developed by the Harris Project & WJCS that brings teens together for fun, supportive, and wellness-centered…\n\nAbout this event\n\nJoin Jeffrey from Inclure, a program developed by the Harris Project & WJCS that brings teens together for fun, supportive, and wellness-centered programming. Each week, we'll explore different ways to improve physical, mental, and emotional well-being. Whether it's through stress management techniques, light movement, or guided breathing exercises, teens will develop skills to build confidence, foster positive relationships, and enhance their overall sense of well-being. For teens in grades 7-12 on a first-come, first-served basis. Check the library page for registration, tickets, and any schedule updates.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nPast\n\nDate\n\nMonday, June 22, 2026\n\nTime\n\n4:00 PM - 5:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nAddress\n\n100 Martine Avenue, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Public Library\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nCooking Up Community\n\nJul 22, 2026\n\nJoin Chef Giovanni Green of Break Bread not Hearts for four days of healthy AND delicious cooking!\n\nCooking Up Community\n\nJul 23, 2026\n\nJoin Chef Giovanni Green of Break Bread not Hearts for four days of healthy AND delicious cooking!\n\nEarth, Wind, Fire and Zombies!\n\nAug 12, 2026\n\nSurvive the zombie apocalypse with Zach Jones of Our Elements Outdoor Learning, a nature-based outdoor education organization rooted in the Hudson Valley."
