      "url": "/events/wppac-anastasia-youth-edition-2026-06-29/",
      "type": "event",
      "excerpt": "Anastasia: The Musical is the spectacular new musical about discovering who you are and defining who you’re meant to be.",
      "text": "Anastasia: The Musical is the spectacular new musical about discovering who you are and defining who you’re meant to be.\n\nArts\n\nAnastasia: Youth Edition\n\nAnastasia: The Musical is the spectacular new musical about discovering who you are and defining who you’re meant to be.\n\nAbout this event\n\nAnastasia: The Musical is the spectacular new musical about discovering who you are and defining who you’re meant to be. From Tony winners Terrence Mc Nally, Stephen Flaherty and Lynn Ahrens, creators of such Broadway classics as Ragtime and Once On This Island, this dazzling show transports its audience from the twilight of the Russian Empire to the euphoria of Paris in the 1920s, as a brave young woman sets out to discover the mystery of her past. Pursued by a ruthless Soviet officer determined to silence her, Anya enlists the aid of a dashing con man and a lovable ex-aristocrat. Together, they embark on an epic adventure to help her find home, love and family. $23 Use the show page for tickets and the full performance schedule.\n\nAt a Glance\n\nStatus\n\nPast\n\nDate\n\nMonday, June 29, 2026 to July 18, 2026\n\nTime\n\nSee details\n\nLocation\n\nWhite Plains Performing Arts Center\n\nAddress\n\n11 City Place, 3rd Floor, White Plains, NY 10601\n\nSource\n\nWhite Plains Performing Arts Center\n\nMore Events\n\nRelated events\n\nCatch Me If You Can\n\nApr 10, 2026 - May 3, 2026\n\nA spring run of the musical at the White Plains Performing Arts Center.\n\nRock the Block 2025\n\nMay 21, 2025 - Aug 27, 2025\n\nDowntown summer street music and dining on Mamaroneck Avenue.\n\nBlock-toberfest\n\nOct 26, 2025\n\nA free fall block party with music, games, vendors, and family activities downtown."
